This repository contains original integration/controller code and source snapshots or patches derived from multiple upstream research repositories.

Upstream repository URLs and source revisions are recorded in src/camera_loop/bundled/repos.json. Available upstream license notices are retained under src/camera_loop/bundled/upstream_metadata/ and continue to apply to their respective code. Some pinned sources did not include a captured license notice; no additional redistribution rights are implied for those sources. Consult the upstream project for its terms.

No blanket license is assigned to the combined bundle. Model weights, training data and evaluation data are not included. Their availability and permissions are separate from this source handoff.
